# Board build outputs — ALLOW-LIST for the generated-heavy directories.
#
# A deny-list missed artifacts twice: p8x_cpu.fs (6.9 MB, tracked for days
# because the pattern only said p8x.fs) and mem.hex/ucode.hex (listed here but
# already in the index, which .gitignore cannot undo). Everything below is
# produced by build.sh or a simulator run.
p8x.json
pnr.json
*.fs
*.log
*.hex
*.vh
disk.img

# sim/ holds only hand-written benches; everything else there is generated
# (.vvp binaries, hex images, trace dumps, emulator scratch).
sim/*
!sim/*.v
